h graph into a semantic IR, and a codegen writes that IR out as SwiftUI. Swami","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is also the patch-matched helper library that fills gaps between Origami patches","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"and native SwiftUI — one helper per Origami patch, named after the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example."}],"title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","url":"\/documentation\/swami","role":"collection","type":"topic"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView/gesture(_:name:isEnabled:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView\/gesture(_:name:isEnabled:)","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"gesture"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"genericParameter","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":">("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"T"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"name"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"isEnabled"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:7SwiftUI4ViewP","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"View"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview\/gesture(_:name:isenabled:)","type":"topic","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"gesture(_:name:isEnabled:)"},"doc://samatwork.Swami/documentation/Swami/Interaction_DragView":{"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swami\/interaction_dragview","role":"symbol","title":"Interaction_DragView","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Reproduces the layer hierarchy measured from Origami’s runner render: a full-screen"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"purple canvas, an inset rounded interaction area, and a centered draggable card."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The card maps the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"origami.Drag"},{"type":"text","text":" Position output to its SwiftUI offset. A release"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"projects momentum and applies rubber-band bounds. If the bounded destination is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"within 100 points of center on both axes, the placed graph’s Reset branch returns"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the card to its origin."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami\/Interaction_DragView","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Interaction_DragView","kind":"identifier"}]}}}